(2026621, 278727, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of it but there isn''t a big POW factor.  I''d love to see an old pilon sticking up out of the water, or maybe a boat floating in the water.  Maybe if you played with the contrast of the clouds, that might help too!! Good luck.</td>', 'I like the idea of it but there isn''t a big POW factor.  I''d love to see an old pilon sticking up out of the water, or maybe a boat floating in the water.  Maybe if you played with the contrast of the clouds, that might help too!! Good luck.', '2006-01-11 13:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026633, 279081, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this. The description specifically said no silhouettes though, so although it''s a beautiful image, it sort of doesn''t really follow the rules. The sun seems awfully blown out and almost hurts the eyes. What if you cropped out the sun and just had the beautiful glow on the shore?<br/> <br/>Now, I do like the texture of the water on the sand - making striations of light and shadow. I like the placement of the figure.</td>', 'I like this. The description specifically said no silhouettes though, so although it''s a beautiful image, it sort of doesn''t really follow the rules. The sun seems awfully blown out and almost hurts the eyes. What if you cropped out the sun and just had the beautiful glow on the shore? Now, I do like the texture of the water on the sand - making striations of light and shadow. I like the placement of the figure.', '2006-01-11 13:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026640, 278680, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is interesting.  I like the border. Not crazy about the pile of sugar. What if you had it stuc in a 4 tined fork, or on the end of a wide butcher knife instead... hmmm... just thinking out loud.</td>', 'This is interesting.  I like the border. Not crazy about the pile of sugar. What if you had it stuc in a 4 tined fork, or on the end of a wide butcher knife instead... hmmm... just thinking out loud.', '2006-01-11 13:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026650, 279435, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this has a very sweet sense. I like the fuzzy background. What is on her head? Did she walk through something and it got caught in her main?? I feel as if she''s walking up to say hello. That slight cock to her head is cute. I might remove part of the area to the right so she''s not quite so centered.  Overall, quite appealing to this animal lover!! 7</td>', 'Oh this has a very sweet sense. I like the fuzzy background. What is on her head? Did she walk through something and it got caught in her main?? I feel as if she''s walking up to say hello. That slight cock to her head is cute. I might remove part of the area to the right so she''s not quite so centered.  Overall, quite appealing to this animal lover!! 7', '2006-01-11 13:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026651, 277515, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice close up. Good detailing on the bird''s feathers.  What if you adjusted curves? I think it might enrich the overall tones and really give it some extra POP. 7</td>', 'Nice close up. Good detailing on the bird''s feathers.  What if you adjusted curves? I think it might enrich the overall tones and really give it some extra POP. 7', '2006-01-11 13:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
