(2026667, 278260, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this. It almost borders on a silhouette, but with the dog being black, that makes it kind of hard. I wish you could have dodged the eyes a touch.  Lovely perspective and the view is killer. If you could just adjust the curves on everything but the dog, it''d really give it some pop, but with basic editing, no go.  Overall - I like it.  7</td>', 'I like this. It almost borders on a silhouette, but with the dog being black, that makes it kind of hard. I wish you could have dodged the eyes a touch.  Lovely perspective and the view is killer. If you could just adjust the curves on everything but the dog, it''d really give it some pop, but with basic editing, no go.  Overall - I like it.  7', '2006-01-11 13:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
