(2028078, 278535, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea.  The fingerprints (at least that''s what I think they are) on the glass are distracting, and I think I''d prefer the wine to be in focus, or not have bubbles maybe.  But that''s just me...</td>', 'I really like the idea.  The fingerprints (at least that''s what I think they are) on the glass are distracting, and I think I''d prefer the wine to be in focus, or not have bubbles maybe.  But that''s just me...', '2006-01-11 21:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028091, 279513, 19982, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...  I *love* the picture!  But I don''t see much backlighting going on.  I do see a bit of "side lighting" on the model''s right side... so I''ll give you partial credit.  :-)</td>', 'Hmmm...  I *love* the picture!  But I don''t see much backlighting going on.  I do see a bit of "side lighting" on the model''s right side... so I''ll give you partial credit.  :-)', '2006-01-11 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
