(2028484, 279005, 33515, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this can off the way you intended. The subject isn''t attention grabbing and the glass is dirty. 5</td>', 'I don''t know if this can off the way you intended. The subject isn''t attention grabbing and the glass is dirty. 5', '2006-01-11 23:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028486, 279021, 245, '<td valign="top">The framing at the top is a little tight, I want to see more of the hills in the distance! It takes what could be an expansive landscape and compresses it somewhat. It''s still a beautiful picture, though. :)</td>', 'The framing at the top is a little tight, I want to see more of the hills in the distance! It takes what could be an expansive landscape and compresses it somewhat. It''s still a beautiful picture, though. :)', '2006-01-11 23:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
