(2028960, 279131, 49007, '<td valign="top">Challenge<br/>- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes<br/>- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes<br/> <br/>Compostion<br/>- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? The two trees in the forground are in the way. Zoom in and crop all of the foreground trees. Put the horizon on the top third. Make it about thebarn and the sunrise.<br/>- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes<br/> <br/>Lighting <br/>- Good use of light? Yes<br/> <br/>Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:<br/>- What is my reaction or feelings? It''s average until you remove all of the foreground elements.<br/></td>', 'Challenge- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes Compostion- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? The two trees in the forground are in the way. Zoom in and crop all of the foreground trees. Put the horizon on the top third. Make it about thebarn and the sunrise.- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes Lighting - Good use of light? Yes Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:- What is my reaction or feelings? It''s average until you remove all of the foreground elements.', '2006-01-12 01:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028965, 278174, 49007, '<td valign="top">Tilt it a bit more so that the center axis goes corner to corner. Nice B&amp;W.</td>', 'Tilt it a bit more so that the center axis goes corner to corner. Nice B&W.', '2006-01-12 01:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028969, 279264, 17507, '<td valign="top">this gets extra points for being completely ridiculous :)</td>', 'this gets extra points for being completely ridiculous :)', '2006-01-12 01:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028972, 278126, 49007, '<td valign="top">Soften the foreground lights. They are giving her a blue cast in the face and causing shadowing that doesn''t work for this one.</td>', 'Soften the foreground lights. They are giving her a blue cast in the face and causing shadowing that doesn''t work for this one.', '2006-01-12 01:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028976, 279521, 49865, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely composition. I love the lighting, and the darkness of the background. Since you really seem to know what you''re doing I don''t feel super critical offering some extra comments :)  -&gt; the seeds and filaments are so compelling, beautifully lit and in focus that I''m slightly confused about what the subject is - the ladybug or the plant. The title suggests the former, but the reflection on the back-end of that shiny carapace is so bright, and the darker parts (head, top of carapace near head) disappear into the background - my eye just kept drifting back to the seeds, and for that reason the ladybug is not as compelling as the rest of the image. That may seem really nitpicky, but I wouldn''t have given such specific, criticism if I didn''t think the image was so strong to begin with.</td>', 'This is a lovely composition. I love the lighting, and the darkness of the background. Since you really seem to know what you''re doing I don''t feel super critical offering some extra comments :)  -> the seeds and filaments are so compelling, beautifully lit and in focus that I''m slightly confused about what the subject is - the ladybug or the plant. The title suggests the former, but the reflection on the back-end of that shiny carapace is so bright, and the darker parts (head, top of carapace near head) disappear into the background - my eye just kept drifting back to the seeds, and for that reason the ladybug is not as compelling as the rest of the image. That may seem really nitpicky, but I wouldn''t have given such specific, criticism if I didn''t think the image was so strong to begin with.', '2006-01-12 01:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028978, 279522, 17507, '<td valign="top">oops, the subject is silhouetted... &gt;_&lt;<br/>I do like the composition here - it''s clever and creative.</td>', 'oops, the subject is silhouetted... >_<I do like the composition here - it''s clever and creative.', '2006-01-12 01:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
