(2029447, 279082, 50695, '<td valign="top">good. I don''t consider this a silhouette because it''s even more obscured than a silhouette. I think it fulfills the challenge well. Love a picture that tells a story!</td>', 'good. I don''t consider this a silhouette because it''s even more obscured than a silhouette. I think it fulfills the challenge well. Love a picture that tells a story!', '2006-01-12 08:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029456, 279051, 50695, '<td valign="top">This photograph shows a diabolical spirit in this sculpture. well done.</td>', 'This photograph shows a diabolical spirit in this sculpture. well done.', '2006-01-12 08:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029459, 278727, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this photo a thousand times, but this is an excellent example of it. For some reason I just love that spot of light on the water. The dark but articulated horizon is also fascinating.</td>', 'I''ve seen this photo a thousand times, but this is an excellent example of it. For some reason I just love that spot of light on the water. The dark but articulated horizon is also fascinating.', '2006-01-12 08:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029462, 278183, 50695, '<td valign="top">this photo captures the exact right moment, and I love the texture you''ve created. The darkened faces just emphasize the importance of the gesture, i.e., the touch.</td>', 'this photo captures the exact right moment, and I love the texture you''ve created. The darkened faces just emphasize the importance of the gesture, i.e., the touch.', '2006-01-12 08:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029465, 279513, 50695, '<td valign="top">Backlighting makes it seem like she''s coming out of a window, which serves to create a 3-D emphasis for your joke. The model is making a perfect Christina Applegate expression. I don''t even like studio shots but I''m giving this a 9.</td>', 'Backlighting makes it seem like she''s coming out of a window, which serves to create a 3-D emphasis for your joke. The model is making a perfect Christina Applegate expression. I don''t even like studio shots but I''m giving this a 9.', '2006-01-12 08:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029468, 279093, 50695, '<td valign="top">love that backwards text! I feel like an archaeologist!</td>', 'love that backwards text! I feel like an archaeologist!', '2006-01-12 08:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029471, 279029, 50695, '<td valign="top">great portrait. there is such emotion in the shadows of his face and body. I sense a terrible exhaustion.</td>', 'great portrait. there is such emotion in the shadows of his face and body. I sense a terrible exhaustion.', '2006-01-12 08:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029474, 279593, 50695, '<td valign="top">great use of a long exposure time. The ghostly figure looks like it was painted on the door... or perhaps the afterimage of an atomic explosion! The V of light on the bottom completes the composition. I have 10 10s, and this is one of them.</td>', 'great use of a long exposure time. The ghostly figure looks like it was painted on the door... or perhaps the afterimage of an atomic explosion! The V of light on the bottom completes the composition. I have 10 10s, and this is one of them.', '2006-01-12 08:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029478, 279086, 50695, '<td valign="top">Like the monkeys with darkened faces, the hiding of facial expression gives more importance to the gesture. In this case, it''s the way they''re holding each other around the back, a gesture of mutual support. Not to mention I was hoping to see some backs in a challenge called "backlighting". 10</td>', 'Like the monkeys with darkened faces, the hiding of facial expression gives more importance to the gesture. In this case, it''s the way they''re holding each other around the back, a gesture of mutual support. Not to mention I was hoping to see some backs in a challenge called "backlighting". 10', '2006-01-12 09:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029479, 278560, 50695, '<td valign="top">great color in this. one of my faves. I like "painterly" photos.</td>', 'great color in this. one of my faves. I like "painterly" photos.', '2006-01-12 09:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029487, 279510, 50695, '<td valign="top">the figure is almost silhouetted, but the picture is not simply of the figure. It is at least as much, if not more so, a picture of the net, as your title suggests. Even while it verges on abstraction, the net brings forth all sorts of allegorical and personified meaning. One of my faves for this challenge.</td>', 'the figure is almost silhouetted, but the picture is not simply of the figure. It is at least as much, if not more so, a picture of the net, as your title suggests. Even while it verges on abstraction, the net brings forth all sorts of allegorical and personified meaning. One of my faves for this challenge.', '2006-01-12 09:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029489, 279482, 37719, '<td valign="top">This looks mroe like lit from below as opposed to backlit.</td>', 'This looks mroe like lit from below as opposed to backlit.', '2006-01-12 09:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029490, 278990, 50695, '<td valign="top">the picture''s too small. great concept, though. 8.</td>', 'the picture''s too small. great concept, though. 8.', '2006-01-12 09:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029492, 278894, 40126, '<td valign="top">i would have preferred the orange at the bottom be removed. its distracting to an already stunning image</td>', 'i would have preferred the orange at the bottom be removed. its distracting to an already stunning image', '2006-01-12 09:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
