(2029785, 277630, 39349, '<td valign="top">Tack sharp focus. Amazing colors and composition. Very well done.</td>', 'Tack sharp focus. Amazing colors and composition. Very well done.', '2006-01-12 11:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029814, 279436, 39349, '<td valign="top">I like the composition you''ve chosen with this shot. Well done.</td>', 'I like the composition you''ve chosen with this shot. Well done.', '2006-01-12 11:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029816, 276973, 39349, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve captured the softness of the feathers here. Good job.</td>', 'I like how you''ve captured the softness of the feathers here. Good job.', '2006-01-12 11:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029852, 277762, 34182, '<td valign="top">I had the exact same idea as yours ! Check out the links. <br/> <br/>//i21.photobucket.com/albums/b263/KTManiac/paharcuborduramic.jpg //i21.photobucket.com/albums/b263/KTManiac/pahar2cubordura.jpg<br/> <br/>It''s a pity though that your glass is kind of lost (burned out) in the background, as well as the flowing white wine. And the water drops on the glass are not too welcome, IMHO.</td>', 'I had the exact same idea as yours ! Check out the links.  //i21.photobucket.com/albums/b263/KTManiac/paharcuborduramic.jpg //i21.photobucket.com/albums/b263/KTManiac/pahar2cubordura.jpg It''s a pity though that your glass is kind of lost (burned out) in the background, as well as the flowing white wine. And the water drops on the glass are not too welcome, IMHO.', '2006-01-12 11:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029872, 279354, 13025, '<td valign="top">Nice, delicate backlit image. Among the best in this competition.</td>', 'Nice, delicate backlit image. Among the best in this competition.', '2006-01-12 11:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029875, 278105, 13025, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes and colours.</td>', 'Nice shapes and colours.', '2006-01-12 12:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029889, 278257, 24413, '<td valign="top">This is unusual(in a good way).  I would have liked to have seen it with a different color background.  I think it would have made it even more interesting.</td>', 'This is unusual(in a good way).  I would have liked to have seen it with a different color background.  I think it would have made it even more interesting.', '2006-01-12 12:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029914, 279010, 46885, '<td valign="top">A what, basic editing?!</td>', 'A what, basic editing?!', '2006-01-12 12:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029937, 277975, 42188, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot :)</td>', 'Amazing shot :)', '2006-01-12 12:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029939, 279583, 24413, '<td valign="top">Nice concept,but the background color is a little bland. I think the photo would have had more impact with a brighter or deeper color.</td>', 'Nice concept,but the background color is a little bland. I think the photo would have had more impact with a brighter or deeper color.', '2006-01-12 12:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029945, 279588, 46885, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but a wee bit more of sharpness would make it truly brilliant.</td>', 'Good shot, but a wee bit more of sharpness would make it truly brilliant.', '2006-01-12 12:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029981, 279051, 51125, '<td valign="top">Great idea and interesting lighting.  Too much in center for me.</td>', 'Great idea and interesting lighting.  Too much in center for me.', '2006-01-12 12:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029984, 279367, 51125, '<td valign="top">Classic.</td>', 'Classic.', '2006-01-12 12:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029988, 278126, 50034, '<td valign="top">What a charming young lady!  Sweet picture!<br/>The highlights outlining the hair are nice &amp; really set her off from foreground/background.  <br/>Personally, I would have enjoyed seeing a second back-light set lower to highlight more of the strands of hair.  However, her hair appears to be thick, so I''m not sure how translucent it would be at any angle.<br/>Over-all...Great entry!</td>', 'What a charming young lady!  Sweet picture!The highlights outlining the hair are nice & really set her off from foreground/background.  Personally, I would have enjoyed seeing a second back-light set lower to highlight more of the strands of hair.  However, her hair appears to be thick, so I''m not sure how translucent it would be at any angle.Over-all...Great entry!', '2006-01-12 12:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029990, 278819, 46885, '<td valign="top">This is a very obvious choice of application and so you''d hardly get any points for idea. Blown highlights are a crime in this section. I would also think careful about the angle - you''d hardly get good lines using medium or tele and even if you do it;s going to be boring having just the pews and the window. How about extreme wide angle and some light-shade play on the ceiling?</td>', 'This is a very obvious choice of application and so you''d hardly get any points for idea. Blown highlights are a crime in this section. I would also think careful about the angle - you''d hardly get good lines using medium or tele and even if you do it;s going to be boring having just the pews and the window. How about extreme wide angle and some light-shade play on the ceiling?', '2006-01-12 12:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029993, 277618, 46885, '<td valign="top">Ah! How good. How simple. How come I never get to do this? Bril.</td>', 'Ah! How good. How simple. How come I never get to do this? Bril.', '2006-01-12 12:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2029997, 279411, 51125, '<td valign="top">I love that I can read the label and the timing is exceptional.</td>', 'I love that I can read the label and the timing is exceptional.', '2006-01-12 12:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030004, 277474, 51125, '<td valign="top">Well executed and nice idea but lacks a dynamic feeling.</td>', 'Well executed and nice idea but lacks a dynamic feeling.', '2006-01-12 12:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030005, 278905, 50034, '<td valign="top">Tender...Great photo for demonstrating backlighting, shapes, mirrors &amp; photographic art.  Good composition.  Emotes loving couple, TLC, gentle passion &amp; romance.</td>', 'Tender...Great photo for demonstrating backlighting, shapes, mirrors & photographic art.  Good composition.  Emotes loving couple, TLC, gentle passion & romance.', '2006-01-12 12:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030017, 279074, 50034, '<td valign="top">The tulip appears to be lifts its arms in praise of the Creator!  <br/>Praise the LORD!<br/>Great lighting, Great composition, Great clarity, Great simplicity!  You nailed the concept!</td>', 'The tulip appears to be lifts its arms in praise of the Creator!  Praise the LORD!Great lighting, Great composition, Great clarity, Great simplicity!  You nailed the concept!', '2006-01-12 12:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
