(2030737, 277231, 41794, '<td valign="top">Really like how you did this. The flower "blends" into the black background wonderfully. Unique composition, color is gorgeous.</td>', 'Really like how you did this. The flower "blends" into the black background wonderfully. Unique composition, color is gorgeous.', '2006-01-12 16:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030741, 278174, 41794, '<td valign="top">Good perspective shot and great use of leading lines. The hand rails at either side lead the eye right to the top and the person standing there.</td>', 'Good perspective shot and great use of leading lines. The hand rails at either side lead the eye right to the top and the person standing there.', '2006-01-12 16:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030748, 278124, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great smile, good back/front-lighting balance and nice portrait overall.  Looks front-focussed, focus locked on eyes would be better.</td>', 'Great smile, good back/front-lighting balance and nice portrait overall.  Looks front-focussed, focus locked on eyes would be better.', '2006-01-12 16:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030763, 277189, 50756, '<td valign="top">Cool leaves! It looks like a bird and a dog facing each other.</td>', 'Cool leaves! It looks like a bird and a dog facing each other.', '2006-01-12 17:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030766, 276878, 31230, '<td valign="top">Something about it seems over the top.  Not sure.  I can see your definite backlighting, but it seems like too much light.  Maybe adjusting to half or even quarter power (that is if you used strobes) would have given this a nicer less harsh light.  Just my thoughts.</td>', 'Something about it seems over the top.  Not sure.  I can see your definite backlighting, but it seems like too much light.  Maybe adjusting to half or even quarter power (that is if you used strobes) would have given this a nicer less harsh light.  Just my thoughts.', '2006-01-12 17:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030769, 279537, 31230, '<td valign="top">Wow, is all I can say, wow.  I love this. Nice silhouette.</td>', 'Wow, is all I can say, wow.  I love this. Nice silhouette.', '2006-01-12 17:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030772, 279021, 31230, '<td valign="top">Nice rolling hills.</td>', 'Nice rolling hills.', '2006-01-12 17:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030773, 278174, 31230, '<td valign="top">Cool silhouette</td>', 'Cool silhouette', '2006-01-12 17:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030774, 277607, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and colors.  More front lighting would help, just enough to brighten the colors in the upper left and not too much to loose the nice backlighting and transparency effects.  It''s really more like, Roy G. B., but that''s picky and irrelevant.</td>', 'Nice idea and colors.  More front lighting would help, just enough to brighten the colors in the upper left and not too much to loose the nice backlighting and transparency effects.  It''s really more like, Roy G. B., but that''s picky and irrelevant.', '2006-01-12 17:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030785, 277211, 50130, '<td valign="top">really cool reflection of the camera in the eye!</td>', 'really cool reflection of the camera in the eye!', '2006-01-12 17:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030787, 277020, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Somewhat difficult to confirm backlighting, but close enough.  Less central composition would be better.  Wish that it were built from obviously bioactive items, like transparent gelcaps or blood-like liquid.  I still like it.</td>', 'Nice idea. Somewhat difficult to confirm backlighting, but close enough.  Less central composition would be better.  Wish that it were built from obviously bioactive items, like transparent gelcaps or blood-like liquid.  I still like it.', '2006-01-12 17:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030800, 279535, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and textures.  Better focus/sharpness and less uniform/blocky composition would help.</td>', 'Nice colors and textures.  Better focus/sharpness and less uniform/blocky composition would help.', '2006-01-12 17:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030802, 278823, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement.  One additional element/color would really make it.</td>', 'Nice arrangement.  One additional element/color would really make it.', '2006-01-12 17:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030807, 277563, 44490, '<td valign="top">Naturally elegant transparency, texture, and shadows.  Wish that a little more of the out-of-focus foreground bottom were cropped out.</td>', 'Naturally elegant transparency, texture, and shadows.  Wish that a little more of the out-of-focus foreground bottom were cropped out.', '2006-01-12 17:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030823, 277589, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice edge fringe fits the challenge, especially on the shadow.  Wish for less straight-on composition and more sharpness/DOF.</td>', 'Nice edge fringe fits the challenge, especially on the shadow.  Wish for less straight-on composition and more sharpness/DOF.', '2006-01-12 17:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030834, 278334, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice balance front and backlighting.  Too bad about the focus-miss evident from the sharp carpet in the upper left corner background.  My guess is that you were too close for minimum focus of your camera/lens, just back up to minimum focus distance and crop in software.</td>', 'Nice balance front and backlighting.  Too bad about the focus-miss evident from the sharp carpet in the upper left corner background.  My guess is that you were too close for minimum focus of your camera/lens, just back up to minimum focus distance and crop in software.', '2006-01-12 17:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030838, 279559, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling reminiscent of Ansel Adams.  Less central composition would be better.</td>', 'Nice feeling reminiscent of Ansel Adams.  Less central composition would be better.', '2006-01-12 17:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030848, 278538, 44490, '<td valign="top">Sharp edged backlight works nicely.  Better focus/sharpness and subject brightness would help.</td>', 'Sharp edged backlight works nicely.  Better focus/sharpness and subject brightness would help.', '2006-01-12 17:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030855, 278775, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and background lights.  More brightness/illumination of the ball would help.</td>', 'Nice composition and background lights.  More brightness/illumination of the ball would help.', '2006-01-12 17:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030857, 279374, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and lighting of subject for challenge.  Focus seems to be on lips, focus on eyes would be better, with DOF to include lips.  Seems to have a couple of hot pixels.</td>', 'Nice capture and lighting of subject for challenge.  Focus seems to be on lips, focus on eyes would be better, with DOF to include lips.  Seems to have a couple of hot pixels.', '2006-01-12 17:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030858, 278872, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice lights.  Would be better without the angle.</td>', 'Nice lights.  Would be better without the angle.', '2006-01-12 17:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030877, 277186, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and bee capture.  Cropping out more of the left side negitive space would be better.</td>', 'Nice colors and bee capture.  Cropping out more of the left side negitive space would be better.', '2006-01-12 17:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030887, 278914, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice juxtaposition of the two lamps.  Both lamps lit would be better, as the front darkness is too dominantly obscurring.</td>', 'Nice juxtaposition of the two lamps.  Both lamps lit would be better, as the front darkness is too dominantly obscurring.', '2006-01-12 17:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030891, 278995, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice color and composition.  Bigger would be better - please make large dimension 640 pixels - see tutorial.</td>', 'Nice color and composition.  Bigger would be better - please make large dimension 640 pixels - see tutorial.', '2006-01-12 17:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030907, 277695, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  The circular part can''t hold our attention, and the central background whatever is out of focus - the image needs some primary subject that is sharp.</td>', 'Nice colors.  The circular part can''t hold our attention, and the central background whatever is out of focus - the image needs some primary subject that is sharp.', '2006-01-12 17:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030908, 279417, 30018, '<td valign="top">I hate the hat, but absolutely love the rest of the picture.  Great job of backlighting, and not loosing the detail in the forground.  You might have even been able to go a little darker, but this is a very nice image.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'I hate the hat, but absolutely love the rest of the picture.  Great job of backlighting, and not loosing the detail in the forground.  You might have even been able to go a little darker, but this is a very nice image.  <9>', '2006-01-12 17:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030911, 279572, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image, but I''m affraid its not going to score well because of the challenge defination states: "the subject must not become a silhouette because of the backlighting."  I hope you do well, as this is a great shot</td>', 'This is a beautiful image, but I''m affraid its not going to score well because of the challenge defination states: "the subject must not become a silhouette because of the backlighting."  I hope you do well, as this is a great shot', '2006-01-12 17:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030913, 279521, 30018, '<td valign="top">beautiful &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'beautiful <9>', '2006-01-12 17:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030915, 278819, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice window.  Less foreground and less central composition would be better.</td>', 'Nice window.  Less foreground and less central composition would be better.', '2006-01-12 17:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030919, 276930, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, both front and back, nice colors.  Less central composition would be better.</td>', 'Nice lighting, both front and back, nice colors.  Less central composition would be better.', '2006-01-12 17:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030980, 279513, 42588, '<td valign="top">maybe a little too much contrast</td>', 'maybe a little too much contrast', '2006-01-12 18:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030991, 279010, 42588, '<td valign="top">beautiful color</td>', 'beautiful color', '2006-01-12 18:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030993, 279458, 42588, '<td valign="top">too much burn</td>', 'too much burn', '2006-01-12 18:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030998, 279400, 42588, '<td valign="top">it would be cool if you moved that plant down (or the girl up) so that it looked like she was smelling the leaf.... or put some flowers in there.</td>', 'it would be cool if you moved that plant down (or the girl up) so that it looked like she was smelling the leaf.... or put some flowers in there.', '2006-01-12 18:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031010, 278990, 11793, '<td valign="top">i see the emotion here - but the photo doesn''t seem to do it justice.</td>', 'i see the emotion here - but the photo doesn''t seem to do it justice.', '2006-01-12 18:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031024, 278043, 42588, '<td valign="top">backlighting?</td>', 'backlighting?', '2006-01-12 18:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031027, 277898, 42588, '<td valign="top">lens flare is distracting</td>', 'lens flare is distracting', '2006-01-12 18:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031031, 279021, 42588, '<td valign="top">croping is a little tight...</td>', 'croping is a little tight...', '2006-01-12 18:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031032, 279444, 42588, '<td valign="top">cropping is a little tight...</td>', 'cropping is a little tight...', '2006-01-12 18:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031042, 278479, 42588, '<td valign="top">needs to be straight...</td>', 'needs to be straight...', '2006-01-12 18:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031044, 279565, 42588, '<td valign="top">american psycho?</td>', 'american psycho?', '2006-01-12 18:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031055, 278623, 42588, '<td valign="top">better than the other oranges I have seen in this challenge</td>', 'better than the other oranges I have seen in this challenge', '2006-01-12 18:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031088, 276708, 25754, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject and such vibrant colours. Look at that bokeh! It''s almost competing for my attention against the flower.</td>', 'Beautiful subject and such vibrant colours. Look at that bokeh! It''s almost competing for my attention against the flower.', '2006-01-12 18:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031153, 278025, 24013, '<td valign="top">nice detail in the foreground</td>', 'nice detail in the foreground', '2006-01-12 19:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031160, 278389, 43434, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like the border here, it is distracting by not being even and takes away from the picture as is too heavy.<br/> <br/>I like the picture itself ... it is really quite interesting.  <br/> <br/>I found the lighting a bit dark, I would like the light to work slightly more on the cherries - give them context in the picture.  <br/> <br/>I like the depth of field that you have used ... the cropping also works .. I don''t even think that a huge border should be used to compensate for cropping - even a thin border works for this.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps.<br/> <br/>Kari</td>', 'I really don''t like the border here, it is distracting by not being even and takes away from the picture as is too heavy. I like the picture itself ... it is really quite interesting.   I found the lighting a bit dark, I would like the light to work slightly more on the cherries - give them context in the picture.   I like the depth of field that you have used ... the cropping also works .. I don''t even think that a huge border should be used to compensate for cropping - even a thin border works for this. Hope this helps. Kari', '2006-01-12 19:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031164, 277183, 49672, '<td valign="top">This isn''t backlit - the light is hitting it from underneath.</td>', 'This isn''t backlit - the light is hitting it from underneath.', '2006-01-12 19:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031165, 278312, 49672, '<td valign="top">This is hard to make out because it is so blurry.</td>', 'This is hard to make out because it is so blurry.', '2006-01-12 19:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031167, 278544, 49672, '<td valign="top">This is pretty neat - it looks unreal.</td>', 'This is pretty neat - it looks unreal.', '2006-01-12 19:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031170, 278115, 49672, '<td valign="top">The bright blown-out ring distracts from an otherwise neat idea.</td>', 'The bright blown-out ring distracts from an otherwise neat idea.', '2006-01-12 19:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031173, 277474, 49672, '<td valign="top">Chimay?</td>', 'Chimay?', '2006-01-12 19:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031179, 278768, 42588, '<td valign="top">looks like a figer in the way</td>', 'looks like a figer in the way', '2006-01-12 19:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031180, 279074, 42588, '<td valign="top">nice for a flower shot</td>', 'nice for a flower shot', '2006-01-12 19:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031181, 279029, 49672, '<td valign="top">Would have been nice to have focus on the face (especially given the condition of the poor boxer) but I like the composition and subject.</td>', 'Would have been nice to have focus on the face (especially given the condition of the poor boxer) but I like the composition and subject.', '2006-01-12 19:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031183, 279201, 42588, '<td valign="top">well at least its not and orange lemon or lime.......</td>', 'well at least its not and orange lemon or lime.......', '2006-01-12 19:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031188, 278769, 42588, '<td valign="top">nice dof</td>', 'nice dof', '2006-01-12 19:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031193, 278769, 49672, '<td valign="top">Superb.</td>', 'Superb.', '2006-01-12 19:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031194, 279054, 42588, '<td valign="top">didn''t know the moon was so.... bright?</td>', 'didn''t know the moon was so.... bright?', '2006-01-12 19:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031196, 279559, 42588, '<td valign="top">maybe a little too much burn on the top part.</td>', 'maybe a little too much burn on the top part.', '2006-01-12 19:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031204, 278479, 49672, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm...I work near some of those and have a lot of these shots.  I like the colors.  I would rotate it slightly counter-clockwise.</td>', 'Hmmmm...I work near some of those and have a lot of these shots.  I like the colors.  I would rotate it slightly counter-clockwise.', '2006-01-12 19:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031205, 276551, 42588, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm time stamp</td>', 'Mmmmm time stamp', '2006-01-12 19:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031207, 276572, 49672, '<td valign="top">This isn''t backlit.</td>', 'This isn''t backlit.', '2006-01-12 19:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031251, 279469, 5112, '<td valign="top">I''ve been coming back to this image a couple times, and I can''t quite make up my mind about it.  It certainly gets the attention, and it is so sharp all over, and the reds are beautiful.  It looks like a -dax in focus and not quite.  I am not sure what to think about it.  It is very different from my own conception of what an interpretation of "flow" would be - to my eyes it''s beautiful, very beautiful, but static, very "floaty" rather than "flowy".  Also, for some unknown reason, I keep wanting to look at the picture either sideways or upside-down (like it better sideways, from the right).  Whoever you are, I really hope you don''t mind this rambling comment.</td>', 'I''ve been coming back to this image a couple times, and I can''t quite make up my mind about it.  It certainly gets the attention, and it is so sharp all over, and the reds are beautiful.  It looks like a -dax in focus and not quite.  I am not sure what to think about it.  It is very different from my own conception of what an interpretation of "flow" would be - to my eyes it''s beautiful, very beautiful, but static, very "floaty" rather than "flowy".  Also, for some unknown reason, I keep wanting to look at the picture either sideways or upside-down (like it better sideways, from the right).  Whoever you are, I really hope you don''t mind this rambling comment.', '2006-01-12 20:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031299, 279434, 51180, '<td valign="top">thThats awsome</td>', 'thThats awsome', '2006-01-12 20:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031302, 279469, 49494, '<td valign="top">there''s something about this image that stirs my curiosity. I''m not quite certain but the colors has something to do with it. The sharpness is quite amazing. Great job!</td>', 'there''s something about this image that stirs my curiosity. I''m not quite certain but the colors has something to do with it. The sharpness is quite amazing. Great job!', '2006-01-12 20:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031306, 278616, 49494, '<td valign="top">Great bokeh! Too bad for the blade of grass from the right but it''s an amazingly stunning and simple image.</td>', 'Great bokeh! Too bad for the blade of grass from the right but it''s an amazingly stunning and simple image.', '2006-01-12 20:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031307, 279390, 24628, '<td valign="top">Is that a Vader helmet?  Interesting from above!</td>', 'Is that a Vader helmet?  Interesting from above!', '2006-01-12 20:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031310, 279138, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like this composition very much - it works especially well with the backlighting.  It might look even better if the horizontal lines on the board matched up with the horizontal of the photo, and I''d not crop it quite so tight - include the bases of the knights in the foreground.</td>', 'I like this composition very much - it works especially well with the backlighting.  It might look even better if the horizontal lines on the board matched up with the horizontal of the photo, and I''d not crop it quite so tight - include the bases of the knights in the foreground.', '2006-01-12 20:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031315, 279600, 7628, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea - you''ve caught two worlds: the one inside the glass and the one outside the glass.  It would meet the challenge better (IMO) if there were a strong light insdie the cafe backlighting a stong subject - making it seem to pop through the glass.</td>', 'An interesting idea - you''ve caught two worlds: the one inside the glass and the one outside the glass.  It would meet the challenge better (IMO) if there were a strong light insdie the cafe backlighting a stong subject - making it seem to pop through the glass.', '2006-01-12 20:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031316, 278623, 49494, '<td valign="top">Great cook book image! Absolutelyu delighting and refreshing to look at ;)</td>', 'Great cook book image! Absolutelyu delighting and refreshing to look at ;)', '2006-01-12 20:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031317, 279577, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice use of light and depth of focus to compose a picture.  Good title too. The gate doesn''t seem quite sharp but still a stong image.</td>', 'Nice use of light and depth of focus to compose a picture.  Good title too. The gate doesn''t seem quite sharp but still a stong image.', '2006-01-12 20:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031319, 278963, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very neat and clean.  I like the trick with the eye, but it does look pasted on - perhaps it is a bit bright?</td>', 'Very neat and clean.  I like the trick with the eye, but it does look pasted on - perhaps it is a bit bright?', '2006-01-12 20:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031323, 279121, 7628, '<td valign="top">very impressionistic.    I''m not fond of the blur and the blown out petals, but from an abstract point of view it works nicely.  The colors work well together.</td>', 'very impressionistic.    I''m not fond of the blur and the blown out petals, but from an abstract point of view it works nicely.  The colors work well together.', '2006-01-12 20:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031330, 277762, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, fun idea.  Seems a bit grainy in places - what ISO did you use - a high one to get the shutter speed down?</td>', 'Nice lighting, fun idea.  Seems a bit grainy in places - what ISO did you use - a high one to get the shutter speed down?', '2006-01-12 20:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031333, 279175, 7628, '<td valign="top">Love the smoke illuminated from behind.  Good DOF and light to highlight the subject - daring and unusual subject in a challenge full of still lifes.</td>', 'Love the smoke illuminated from behind.  Good DOF and light to highlight the subject - daring and unusual subject in a challenge full of still lifes.', '2006-01-12 20:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031340, 278394, 7628, '<td valign="top">A good item to backlight as the light shining through really shows off the color.  This does nnot seem very sharp and a lot of details are lost - these are flowers in glass?  Perhaps a little light from below or slightly to the side as well would bring out more in the subject.</td>', 'A good item to backlight as the light shining through really shows off the color.  This does nnot seem very sharp and a lot of details are lost - these are flowers in glass?  Perhaps a little light from below or slightly to the side as well would bring out more in the subject.', '2006-01-12 20:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031342, 277630, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract with a good relation to the subject.</td>', 'Nice abstract with a good relation to the subject.', '2006-01-12 20:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031343, 279513, 16739, '<td valign="top">I don''t see this to be backlit</td>', 'I don''t see this to be backlit', '2006-01-12 20:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031344, 276884, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice glow - it would be tempting to try more contrast - but this makes the light softer, very pleasant.</td>', 'Nice glow - it would be tempting to try more contrast - but this makes the light softer, very pleasant.', '2006-01-12 20:49:49.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2031346, 279270, 7628, '<td valign="top">great subject, great light - her hair catches the light beautifully.  I find the background distracting.  You could shoot somewher else, or use a narrower depth of focus.</td>', 'great subject, great light - her hair catches the light beautifully.  I find the background distracting.  You could shoot somewher else, or use a narrower depth of focus.', '2006-01-12 20:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031354, 278953, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract, great color and the backlighting works to show use details about the subject we would not otherwise note.  The water droplets give nice detail and depth.  Good composition.  Would look better with a completely white background - you''ve got some color/shading  in the top corners that is a tiny bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice abstract, great color and the backlighting works to show use details about the subject we would not otherwise note.  The water droplets give nice detail and depth.  Good composition.  Would look better with a completely white background - you''ve got some color/shading  in the top corners that is a tiny bit distracting.', '2006-01-12 20:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031355, 277485, 16739, '<td valign="top">she needs a razor</td>', 'she needs a razor', '2006-01-12 20:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031358, 277189, 7628, '<td valign="top">very cool subject.  nice light and focus.  i would not crop so close leave some more of that great green surrounding the leaf - it feels a bit cramped this way.</td>', 'very cool subject.  nice light and focus.  i would not crop so close leave some more of that great green surrounding the leaf - it feels a bit cramped this way.', '2006-01-12 20:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031360, 277898, 7628, '<td valign="top">The horizon is tilted and it pulls my eye away from the great golden leaf.  Good subject tho.</td>', 'The horizon is tilted and it pulls my eye away from the great golden leaf.  Good subject tho.', '2006-01-12 20:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031363, 278680, 7628, '<td valign="top">wow.  The white of the sugar continues in the halo of light around the raspberry - lovely!  Great detail, focus, color.  I love it!</td>', 'wow.  The white of the sugar continues in the halo of light around the raspberry - lovely!  Great detail, focus, color.  I love it!', '2006-01-12 20:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031364, 278702, 16739, '<td valign="top">very good , should be in top 5</td>', 'very good , should be in top 5', '2006-01-12 20:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
