(2031409, 279084, 7628, '<td valign="top">This image lacks color (or contrast) and detail.  The imposing building is a good choice of subject - more huge and imposing backlit.  I wish the texture of the bricks and ivy were more of a focus - get closer in to the building and compose the picture with the ivy filling the foreground, and the texture of the bricks highlighted by the light?</td>', 'This image lacks color (or contrast) and detail.  The imposing building is a good choice of subject - more huge and imposing backlit.  I wish the texture of the bricks and ivy were more of a focus - get closer in to the building and compose the picture with the ivy filling the foreground, and the texture of the bricks highlighted by the light?', '2006-01-12 21:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
