(2032879, 279045, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice color, interesting reflection, even like the vignetting.  Wish there were more backlighting effect to fit the challenge or that it were the Shapes challenge, but I like it a lot.</td>', 'Nice color, interesting reflection, even like the vignetting.  Wish there were more backlighting effect to fit the challenge or that it were the Shapes challenge, but I like it a lot.', '2006-01-13 11:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032882, 279450, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of refraction and liquid (un)level standards that I almost missed.  But the verticals and too-central composition is overwhelming, some additional background shapes and not-so-central composition would be better.  Did you mean "Stripeometer," or how about "Tipometer" to make sure people didn''t miss the liquid (un)level?</td>', 'Nice combination of refraction and liquid (un)level standards that I almost missed.  But the verticals and too-central composition is overwhelming, some additional background shapes and not-so-central composition would be better.  Did you mean "Stripeometer," or how about "Tipometer" to make sure people didn''t miss the liquid (un)level?', '2006-01-13 11:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
