(2033667, 278627, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think the business of the window panes in this shot really takes away from what could have been a really nice closer up shot of the bloom.  The natural light coming in from behind the flower is nice, but I would have come in much closer to the flower.</td>', 'I think the business of the window panes in this shot really takes away from what could have been a really nice closer up shot of the bloom.  The natural light coming in from behind the flower is nice, but I would have come in much closer to the flower.', '2006-01-13 16:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
