(2033689, 278989, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like the golden tones and the lighting off the glasses, but there is just a bit too much going on here to really have an impact on me.  I find it too busy.</td>', 'I like the golden tones and the lighting off the glasses, but there is just a bit too much going on here to really have an impact on me.  I find it too busy.', '2006-01-13 16:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033692, 277145, 42100, '<td valign="top">You chose a very difficult photo for the backlighting.  Get the deatil in the tower and lose the sky, or get the sky and lose the detail.  You did a pretty good job of finding the middle ground.  I think framing the photo so that the tower was to one side or the other would make the photo more dynamic and give it better balance.</td>', 'You chose a very difficult photo for the backlighting.  Get the deatil in the tower and lose the sky, or get the sky and lose the detail.  You did a pretty good job of finding the middle ground.  I think framing the photo so that the tower was to one side or the other would make the photo more dynamic and give it better balance.', '2006-01-13 16:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
