(2033855, 279527, 22046, '<td valign="top">Really lovely lighting here. And the focus is sharp too.</td>', 'Really lovely lighting here. And the focus is sharp too.', '2006-01-13 17:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033858, 279010, 22046, '<td valign="top">Wow what a sunset. Hope they didn''t get water on their guitars.</td>', 'Wow what a sunset. Hope they didn''t get water on their guitars.', '2006-01-13 17:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033859, 278233, 22046, '<td valign="top">Feels very cold in spite of the warm color. Nice found composition.</td>', 'Feels very cold in spite of the warm color. Nice found composition.', '2006-01-13 17:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033861, 279534, 22046, '<td valign="top">I like this one. It makes me think of ghost towns like Bodie, CA. The lighting is lovely.</td>', 'I like this one. It makes me think of ghost towns like Bodie, CA. The lighting is lovely.', '2006-01-13 17:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033862, 279469, 22046, '<td valign="top">Great color here.</td>', 'Great color here.', '2006-01-13 17:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033863, 279521, 22046, '<td valign="top">I like the sweep of the grain across the image.</td>', 'I like the sweep of the grain across the image.', '2006-01-13 17:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033865, 278680, 22046, '<td valign="top">Lovely color.</td>', 'Lovely color.', '2006-01-13 17:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033867, 279434, 22046, '<td valign="top">This is fun. The glow works very well and I like the blue highlights.</td>', 'This is fun. The glow works very well and I like the blue highlights.', '2006-01-13 17:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033875, 278769, 7628, '<td valign="top">Driving down the highway yesterday I saw just this sight!  You''ve done a good job capturing the brilliance of the angled sunlight and the golden color of the grass.  Good use of depth of focus.</td>', 'Driving down the highway yesterday I saw just this sight!  You''ve done a good job capturing the brilliance of the angled sunlight and the golden color of the grass.  Good use of depth of focus.', '2006-01-13 17:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033883, 277931, 43531, '<td valign="top">I think it would be better if you crop it</td>', 'I think it would be better if you crop it', '2006-01-13 17:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033884, 278312, 7628, '<td valign="top">Despite the color and glow of this picture, I find it hard to pick out a central object - the cala is not in focus, and the backlighiting is so extreem you''ve lost a lot of detail.  The rose is not in focus either.  You''ve pushed the yellow so far you''ve gotten some odd artifacts in the center of the cala.</td>', 'Despite the color and glow of this picture, I find it hard to pick out a central object - the cala is not in focus, and the backlighiting is so extreem you''ve lost a lot of detail.  The rose is not in focus either.  You''ve pushed the yellow so far you''ve gotten some odd artifacts in the center of the cala.', '2006-01-13 17:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033888, 279572, 7628, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, and good composition with a subtle diagonal between the shoulder on the view''s right to the tips of the blowing hair on the upper left.  Abstract, but meaningful.  I really enjoy this.</td>', 'Great lighting, and good composition with a subtle diagonal between the shoulder on the view''s right to the tips of the blowing hair on the upper left.  Abstract, but meaningful.  I really enjoy this.', '2006-01-13 17:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033893, 279580, 7628, '<td valign="top">Good color and subject (alas a lot of citus in this challenge) Focus a bit soft.</td>', 'Good color and subject (alas a lot of citus in this challenge) Focus a bit soft.', '2006-01-13 17:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033895, 277971, 7628, '<td valign="top">Your background is distracting and the flash burst and glare draws the eyes away from the subject which I wish were in focus.  I like the way the light captures the texture of your hair - there''s on good piece for the challenge.  Setting a table lamp without its shade behind yourself and the camera on a tripod or table in fron of you would be a better start.  A dark background, or at least a uniform one would emphasize the subject better.</td>', 'Your background is distracting and the flash burst and glare draws the eyes away from the subject which I wish were in focus.  I like the way the light captures the texture of your hair - there''s on good piece for the challenge.  Setting a table lamp without its shade behind yourself and the camera on a tripod or table in fron of you would be a better start.  A dark background, or at least a uniform one would emphasize the subject better.', '2006-01-13 17:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033898, 279521, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very nice - good lighting, nice colors, fun subject.  Strong diagonal composition is an ironic companion to the delicate ladybug - creates some nice tension.  Light a little blown out on the bug, and focus seems a bit soft. Very enjoyable!</td>', 'Very nice - good lighting, nice colors, fun subject.  Strong diagonal composition is an ironic companion to the delicate ladybug - creates some nice tension.  Light a little blown out on the bug, and focus seems a bit soft. Very enjoyable!', '2006-01-13 17:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033901, 279593, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation - good idea for this challenge.  Do I even see "bones" in the arm?  Wish the person were a bit more distinct (I know they are supposed to be ghostly) The light from the door is so bright it really draws the eye away from the person and I didn''t see them at first - perhaps making the light more subtle would reach a balance?</td>', 'Interesting interpretation - good idea for this challenge.  Do I even see "bones" in the arm?  Wish the person were a bit more distinct (I know they are supposed to be ghostly) The light from the door is so bright it really draws the eye away from the person and I didn''t see them at first - perhaps making the light more subtle would reach a balance?', '2006-01-13 17:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033921, 277256, 7628, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, focus good, nice color, and well lit but the lighitng seems to come predominantly from the side.  I can''t see this as an effective use of backlighting.  Really a nice photo though shows the talent of the photographer.</td>', 'Lovely image, focus good, nice color, and well lit but the lighitng seems to come predominantly from the side.  I can''t see this as an effective use of backlighting.  Really a nice photo though shows the talent of the photographer.', '2006-01-13 17:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033925, 278623, 45320, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus and lighting:)</td>', 'Perfect focus and lighting:)', '2006-01-13 17:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033926, 276973, 33947, '<td valign="top">SUBERB lighting on the feathers and on the handle and right side of the purse as well. One of my favorites. You deserve a ribbon.</td>', 'SUBERB lighting on the feathers and on the handle and right side of the purse as well. One of my favorites. You deserve a ribbon.', '2006-01-13 17:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033927, 278692, 7628, '<td valign="top">Unusual, abstract but anchored by the real world, I like the frilly details of the anthers(?) and they have a nice touch of backlighting to highlight them.  Nice thirds composition.  The dark corners draw my eyes away and the subject is so subtle it just doesn''t hold my attention somehow.</td>', 'Unusual, abstract but anchored by the real world, I like the frilly details of the anthers(?) and they have a nice touch of backlighting to highlight them.  Nice thirds composition.  The dark corners draw my eyes away and the subject is so subtle it just doesn''t hold my attention somehow.', '2006-01-13 18:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033929, 279506, 33947, '<td valign="top">like the trasparency of the leaves, and the soft pastel tones.</td>', 'like the trasparency of the leaves, and the soft pastel tones.', '2006-01-13 18:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033930, 276878, 45320, '<td valign="top">I have given you a 9 as you have found somthing other than fruit to shoot and I like the lighting:)</td>', 'I have given you a 9 as you have found somthing other than fruit to shoot and I like the lighting:)', '2006-01-13 18:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033932, 278872, 45320, '<td valign="top">I am not sure how many people will see the clock is backlit:)) took me a while to see it. The angle is very good:) great work</td>', 'I am not sure how many people will see the clock is backlit:)) took me a while to see it. The angle is very good:) great work', '2006-01-13 18:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033936, 278692, 11793, '<td valign="top">good use of color.  good luck.</td>', 'good use of color.  good luck.', '2006-01-13 18:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033939, 279448, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love how you zoomed in for this shot. The perspective brings you right into the plant, and you cropped it nicely. Great lighting and the background color is a wonderful color behind the green. Nice job.</td>', 'Love how you zoomed in for this shot. The perspective brings you right into the plant, and you cropped it nicely. Great lighting and the background color is a wonderful color behind the green. Nice job.', '2006-01-13 18:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033940, 279436, 33947, '<td valign="top">The clarity is fabulous. Neat composition and positioning, too.</td>', 'The clarity is fabulous. Neat composition and positioning, too.', '2006-01-13 18:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033944, 279276, 7628, '<td valign="top">Magical tone - I like the golden color despite the cold snow.  Composition feels a bit random - bits of branches at top and on left distract.  Focus is soft - which might be thematic, but with the soft contrast it feels mushy.</td>', 'Magical tone - I like the golden color despite the cold snow.  Composition feels a bit random - bits of branches at top and on left distract.  Focus is soft - which might be thematic, but with the soft contrast it feels mushy.', '2006-01-13 18:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033945, 277515, 50056, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, nice BG...the only small thing that bothers me (slightly) is the bright spot on R/S</td>', 'A nice shot, nice BG...the only small thing that bothers me (slightly) is the bright spot on R/S', '2006-01-13 18:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033947, 279354, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very unusual, glorious colors, nice blend of backlighting and narrow DOF with a fine point of interest.</td>', 'Very unusual, glorious colors, nice blend of backlighting and narrow DOF with a fine point of interest.', '2006-01-13 18:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033951, 278914, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very subtle and nice shot. Like how you used shadow.</td>', 'Very subtle and nice shot. Like how you used shadow.', '2006-01-13 18:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033952, 278823, 33947, '<td valign="top">LOVE the curved line and dramatic contrast between the blue and white. Great lighting.</td>', 'LOVE the curved line and dramatic contrast between the blue and white. Great lighting.', '2006-01-13 18:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033953, 279434, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the blue hightlight on the water drop and how well it compliments the color of the pepper.  The water on the table is a bit distracting - cleaner if it were a painler reflection - more attention on the real image and the details of the light.  Nice subject.  Very pleasant.</td>', 'I like the blue hightlight on the water drop and how well it compliments the color of the pepper.  The water on the table is a bit distracting - cleaner if it were a painler reflection - more attention on the real image and the details of the light.  Nice subject.  Very pleasant.', '2006-01-13 18:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033955, 279303, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very cool and simple.  I like the layered effect - focus seems a bit soft.</td>', 'Very cool and simple.  I like the layered effect - focus seems a bit soft.', '2006-01-13 18:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033956, 279406, 33947, '<td valign="top">Great action shot and perfect for this challenge.</td>', 'Great action shot and perfect for this challenge.', '2006-01-13 18:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033957, 278905, 50056, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, love the composition.  One small critique, and I honestly don''t know if it could have been avoided, is the shadow on her nose/eye/forehead.  Good luck!</td>', 'A nice shot, love the composition.  One small critique, and I honestly don''t know if it could have been avoided, is the shadow on her nose/eye/forehead.  Good luck!', '2006-01-13 18:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033960, 279367, 7628, '<td valign="top">Wish I were there!  Gorgeous - good pick for the challenge.  I''d crop out the chair in the upper right corner it really pulls away from the composition.</td>', 'Wish I were there!  Gorgeous - good pick for the challenge.  I''d crop out the chair in the upper right corner it really pulls away from the composition.', '2006-01-13 18:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033961, 276708, 33947, '<td valign="top">LOVE this one...especially the flares. Has a soft, magical, ethereal quality that is very nice.</td>', 'LOVE this one...especially the flares. Has a soft, magical, ethereal quality that is very nice.', '2006-01-13 18:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033963, 277346, 33947, '<td valign="top">Like the simplicity of this, and the glowy flares MAKE the shot. Nice job. Hope it does well for you.</td>', 'Like the simplicity of this, and the glowy flares MAKE the shot. Nice job. Hope it does well for you.', '2006-01-13 18:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033965, 279458, 33947, '<td valign="top">I like the soft coloration of the shot.</td>', 'I like the soft coloration of the shot.', '2006-01-13 18:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033967, 279074, 50056, '<td valign="top">nicely done</td>', 'nicely done', '2006-01-13 18:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033968, 278105, 33947, '<td valign="top">Like the curvy lines...very appealing visually. Nice lighting, too.</td>', 'Like the curvy lines...very appealing visually. Nice lighting, too.', '2006-01-13 18:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033970, 277424, 47852, '<td valign="top">Hair clip on a lamp shade?  Interesting.  The lines in the fabric help the composition, but its a tad out of focus.</td>', 'Hair clip on a lamp shade?  Interesting.  The lines in the fabric help the composition, but its a tad out of focus.', '2006-01-13 18:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033971, 278702, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very nice transparent luminosity. Like the contrast with the background. Simple, effective shot. SHARP!</td>', 'Very nice transparent luminosity. Like the contrast with the background. Simple, effective shot. SHARP!', '2006-01-13 18:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033975, 278819, 47852, '<td valign="top">A bit bright... it looks like you might have lost some of the details in the stained glass.  I like the lines that the benches create in the foreground.</td>', 'A bit bright... it looks like you might have lost some of the details in the stained glass.  I like the lines that the benches create in the foreground.', '2006-01-13 18:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033977, 279537, 33947, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the light almost gone. You did well to show the coming darkness without losing the highlights on the water. The border fits the shot well.</td>', 'Nice capture of the light almost gone. You did well to show the coming darkness without losing the highlights on the water. The border fits the shot well.', '2006-01-13 18:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033979, 277145, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the color in the sky, and the crisp clarity of the structure.</td>', 'Love the color in the sky, and the crisp clarity of the structure.', '2006-01-13 18:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033983, 279535, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the soft, muted background with the rich foreground colors. Very appealing shapes, too. Like it.</td>', 'Love the soft, muted background with the rich foreground colors. Very appealing shapes, too. Like it.', '2006-01-13 18:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033984, 279307, 47852, '<td valign="top">Unique angle for this shot. The light seems a bit too bright for me, but it does make for an angry looking expression.</td>', 'Unique angle for this shot. The light seems a bit too bright for me, but it does make for an angry looking expression.', '2006-01-13 18:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033985, 278197, 50056, '<td valign="top">Love the shot, but it is hard to tell if it is "backlit"  Also, his hand appears a bit large, perhaps a slightly higher crop would help?  Good luck with this anyway, I still really like it.</td>', 'Love the shot, but it is hard to tell if it is "backlit"  Also, his hand appears a bit large, perhaps a slightly higher crop would help?  Good luck with this anyway, I still really like it.', '2006-01-13 18:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033988, 279215, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the highlights on the outer part of the catepillar...sharp and luminous.</td>', 'Love the highlights on the outer part of the catepillar...sharp and luminous.', '2006-01-13 18:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033989, 278458, 33947, '<td valign="top">Excellent luminisity, vivid contrast and superb sharpeness. Festive color! Like it.</td>', 'Excellent luminisity, vivid contrast and superb sharpeness. Festive color! Like it.', '2006-01-13 18:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034001, 278165, 32001, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. Nice color, detail &amp; focus.</td>', 'Very cool shot. Nice color, detail & focus.', '2006-01-13 18:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034013, 279522, 32001, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but as I''m sure you''ve already heard 1000 times, silhouettes aren''t allowed in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot, but as I''m sure you''ve already heard 1000 times, silhouettes aren''t allowed in this challenge.', '2006-01-13 18:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034017, 278260, 32001, '<td valign="top">While there is a small amount of detail in the dog, I would still consider this a silhouette, which isn''t allowed in this challenge.</td>', 'While there is a small amount of detail in the dog, I would still consider this a silhouette, which isn''t allowed in this challenge.', '2006-01-13 18:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034018, 279572, 50056, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell you why I like this...but I like this!</td>', 'I can''t tell you why I like this...but I like this!', '2006-01-13 18:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034021, 278990, 50056, '<td valign="top">I wish the image were larger</td>', 'I wish the image were larger', '2006-01-13 18:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034031, 276968, 32001, '<td valign="top">The symetrical composition adds no interest to this shot.  The subject matter is not very interesting from this distance.  I think a closer shot that included only a few blocks would make for a much more interesting photo.</td>', 'The symetrical composition adds no interest to this shot.  The subject matter is not very interesting from this distance.  I think a closer shot that included only a few blocks would make for a much more interesting photo.', '2006-01-13 18:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034047, 279469, 32459, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I just love this.  The gradiant colors really accentuate the subject.</td>', 'Wow.  I just love this.  The gradiant colors really accentuate the subject.', '2006-01-13 18:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034050, 278627, 32459, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I love the perspective.</td>', 'Beautiful!  I love the perspective.', '2006-01-13 18:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034052, 279524, 32459, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2006-01-13 18:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034057, 278197, 32459, '<td valign="top">I love the nervous or somber expression on your subject.  As though he does not know what he is in for.  Good job.</td>', 'I love the nervous or somber expression on your subject.  As though he does not know what he is in for.  Good job.', '2006-01-13 18:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034060, 277975, 32459, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I hope there is a story told behind this.  Crystal clear!  I can even see the teeth on these little guys! Nice shot!</td>', 'Wow!  I hope there is a story told behind this.  Crystal clear!  I can even see the teeth on these little guys! Nice shot!', '2006-01-13 19:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034063, 278769, 32459, '<td valign="top">Pretty</td>', 'Pretty', '2006-01-13 19:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034064, 278696, 32459, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2006-01-13 19:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034066, 279127, 32459, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2006-01-13 19:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034067, 278312, 50056, '<td valign="top">I hate criticizing anyones work and admire anyone who just loves to be behind the lens and shoots away at almost any subject, but since you have posted this to be rated, I''d like to explain why I feel it is not a great shot.  First, your subject (cala, I assume from title) is not really recognizable.  It is cropped off at top and bottom, and very blurry.  Second, the bright spot at top left corner is distracting, as is the dark form on bottom right.  The category is "backlighting" but in this case the actual light source is overpowering.  Try to get a better focus on the subject, and often it helps to put the subject off center, instead of dead center.  Please keep shooting and posting...Best regards</td>', 'I hate criticizing anyones work and admire anyone who just loves to be behind the lens and shoots away at almost any subject, but since you have posted this to be rated, I''d like to explain why I feel it is not a great shot.  First, your subject (cala, I assume from title) is not really recognizable.  It is cropped off at top and bottom, and very blurry.  Second, the bright spot at top left corner is distracting, as is the dark form on bottom right.  The category is "backlighting" but in this case the actual light source is overpowering.  Try to get a better focus on the subject, and often it helps to put the subject off center, instead of dead center.  Please keep shooting and posting...Best regards', '2006-01-13 19:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034068, 277096, 32459, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2006-01-13 19:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
