(2034289, 279441, 49865, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous lighting, charming color. The gold color gives the image a sense of lightness and dignity.</td>', 'Gorgeous lighting, charming color. The gold color gives the image a sense of lightness and dignity.', '2006-01-13 20:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034293, 279559, 49865, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait of this tree. The halo of lighting that follows the major branches makes this all the better.</td>', 'Lovely portrait of this tree. The halo of lighting that follows the major branches makes this all the better.', '2006-01-13 20:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034294, 279133, 49865, '<td valign="top">the best of the "wine glass" photos for this competition.</td>', 'the best of the "wine glass" photos for this competition.', '2006-01-13 20:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034295, 279215, 49865, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome creature.</td>', 'This is an awesome creature.', '2006-01-13 20:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034296, 277239, 47852, '<td valign="top">I thought they were leaves at first... the title helped to bring this shot together for me.  I wish there was just a little more light to make the rest of the bats not so dark but I like the wings spread out on that one guy.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I thought they were leaves at first... the title helped to bring this shot together for me.  I wish there was just a little more light to make the rest of the bats not so dark but I like the wings spread out on that one guy.  Nicely done!', '2006-01-13 20:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034299, 279131, 49865, '<td valign="top">Charming countryside and lighting. The small tree blocking part of the barn is a shame though, this would''ve been even more powerful with the barn in full view.</td>', 'Charming countryside and lighting. The small tree blocking part of the barn is a shame though, this would''ve been even more powerful with the barn in full view.', '2006-01-13 20:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034300, 278949, 49865, '<td valign="top">This look like it could be a movie poster :)</td>', 'This look like it could be a movie poster :)', '2006-01-13 20:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034305, 278544, 49865, '<td valign="top">Okay even though this is hardly an original idea given the enormous quantity of lemon/lime entries in this challenge, the technique and lighting is so stunning that I can''t help but enjoy this. I''m not through all the photos yet but so far this is by far the best fruit photo I''ve seen. I think it could''ve been even stronger with a crop that incorporated more of the peel on the right, for that dark green border.</td>', 'Okay even though this is hardly an original idea given the enormous quantity of lemon/lime entries in this challenge, the technique and lighting is so stunning that I can''t help but enjoy this. I''m not through all the photos yet but so far this is by far the best fruit photo I''ve seen. I think it could''ve been even stronger with a crop that incorporated more of the peel on the right, for that dark green border.', '2006-01-13 20:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034307, 279417, 49865, '<td valign="top">Lovely model. The posture and expression on her face add a lot to the image. Not to menion the hat :)</td>', 'Lovely model. The posture and expression on her face add a lot to the image. Not to menion the hat :)', '2006-01-13 20:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034309, 278842, 49865, '<td valign="top">Well I think the title could''ve done without the second clause, but this image is quite striking. Interesting subject, I love the apparently lack of an abdominal region. Nice crisp black background to bring out the highlighted edges.</td>', 'Well I think the title could''ve done without the second clause, but this image is quite striking. Interesting subject, I love the apparently lack of an abdominal region. Nice crisp black background to bring out the highlighted edges.', '2006-01-13 20:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034310, 279479, 49865, '<td valign="top">I love the question mark in the title, makes you look at the image in a completely different way.</td>', 'I love the question mark in the title, makes you look at the image in a completely different way.', '2006-01-13 20:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034311, 279411, 49865, '<td valign="top">that is a weird looking drop forming. nice photo.</td>', 'that is a weird looking drop forming. nice photo.', '2006-01-13 20:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034312, 276708, 49865, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors</td>', 'beautiful colors', '2006-01-13 20:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
