(2034338, 279435, 49865, '<td valign="top">I love the "mane". Looks like doll hair on the horse''s head. I actually like the tilted horizon - it makes you feel like you''re in the eyes of Mr. Ed, cocking your head to gather your wits before this gorgeous bride-to-be. :)</td>', 'I love the "mane". Looks like doll hair on the horse''s head. I actually like the tilted horizon - it makes you feel like you''re in the eyes of Mr. Ed, cocking your head to gather your wits before this gorgeous bride-to-be. :)', '2006-01-13 20:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
