(2037622, 276653, 24169, '<td valign="top">A nice image but a bit too much of a silhouette for me. I also think it could have been more effective from a different angle, for example less structure in the background at the bottom and simply a cross with the sky.</td>', 'A nice image but a bit too much of a silhouette for me. I also think it could have been more effective from a different angle, for example less structure in the background at the bottom and simply a cross with the sky.', '2006-01-15 04:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
