(2037631, 277272, 24169, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot and I enjoy the wide landscape. A bit more shadowplay could have bumped up my scroe a bit.</td>', 'Interesting shot and I enjoy the wide landscape. A bit more shadowplay could have bumped up my scroe a bit.', '2006-01-15 05:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
