(2037745, 276878, 10785, '<td valign="top">The lighting is great on this photo, but the subject is something else. Not because it is santa, but because it is a nick-nack and therefor uninteresting to me. However, I''ll bet if this photo was used to sell this santa statue on e-bay, you''d get more than your asking price!</td>', 'The lighting is great on this photo, but the subject is something else. Not because it is santa, but because it is a nick-nack and therefor uninteresting to me. However, I''ll bet if this photo was used to sell this santa statue on e-bay, you''d get more than your asking price!', '2006-01-15 08:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
