(2037758, 278758, 10785, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion: In using the portrait orientation, I would have cropped this so the mask was perfectly vertical and split right down the middle.<br/>As far as backlighting is concerned: Yes it is lit from behind. In a classic backlighting picture, there are shadows in the foreground to contrast with the light. This doesn''t depict that.</td>', 'Just my opinion: In using the portrait orientation, I would have cropped this so the mask was perfectly vertical and split right down the middle.As far as backlighting is concerned: Yes it is lit from behind. In a classic backlighting picture, there are shadows in the foreground to contrast with the light. This doesn''t depict that.', '2006-01-15 08:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
