(2038468, 279479, 39465, '<td valign="top">A good comment on the ''good old days'' of photography, before advent of digitalization and websites like these.  A good question to ask, and well executed.</td>', 'A good comment on the ''good old days'' of photography, before advent of digitalization and websites like these.  A good question to ask, and well executed.', '2006-01-15 16:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038470, 278619, 39465, '<td valign="top">It''s good, but I think the angle of backlighting doesn''t play right with the shadows.</td>', 'It''s good, but I think the angle of backlighting doesn''t play right with the shadows.', '2006-01-15 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038472, 278260, 39465, '<td valign="top">This is a really good shot.  However, I can''t give it a 7+ because to me it seems like my attention is being drawn AWAY from the dog and into the scenery around him.  The backlight is supposed to highlight your subject.  Like I said, this is a really really good shot, but i''m not sure it''s right for this challange.</td>', 'This is a really good shot.  However, I can''t give it a 7+ because to me it seems like my attention is being drawn AWAY from the dog and into the scenery around him.  The backlight is supposed to highlight your subject.  Like I said, this is a really really good shot, but i''m not sure it''s right for this challange.', '2006-01-15 16:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
