(2041190, 278775, 30929, '<td valign="top">there is a great sense of movement in this shot thatks to the angle.. The only feedback I could offer is that I would try to capture that movement and give it room to move in the frame by giving more room in the TOP/LEFT or LEFT hand side of this frame, possibly in a slightly looser crop..<br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'there is a great sense of movement in this shot thatks to the angle.. The only feedback I could offer is that I would try to capture that movement and give it room to move in the frame by giving more room in the TOP/LEFT or LEFT hand side of this frame, possibly in a slightly looser crop.. Well done!', '2006-01-16 05:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
