(2041727, 279450, 30929, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea and the composition.  I think it would be helped a little by a few small setup modifications.  If you are trying for clear water with no bubbles, try using water hat has boiled for a few minutes and then cooled... also, these shots always look good when the camera captures the water level dead on without being slightly above it... Also, a good lint free teatowel helps get the glass squeaky clean!!</td>', 'I really like the idea and the composition.  I think it would be helped a little by a few small setup modifications.  If you are trying for clear water with no bubbles, try using water hat has boiled for a few minutes and then cooled... also, these shots always look good when the camera captures the water level dead on without being slightly above it... Also, a good lint free teatowel helps get the glass squeaky clean!!', '2006-01-16 09:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2042104, 279045, 51348, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing.  The vignetting, possibly from a polarizing filter, distracts from the frame had it not been there I would have rated this much higher.</td>', 'Interesting framing.  The vignetting, possibly from a polarizing filter, distracts from the frame had it not been there I would have rated this much higher.', '2006-01-16 10:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
