(2044545, 277145, 38706, '<td valign="top">Might work a little better if the tower were off to one side.  Reminds me, I should take a wander up there when there is snow on the ground (only a few minutes away).</td>', 'Might work a little better if the tower were off to one side.  Reminds me, I should take a wander up there when there is snow on the ground (only a few minutes away).', '2006-01-16 18:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
