(2047877, 278169, 43340, '<td valign="top">Nice use of natural backlighting and the avoidance of silhouettes.  However the dog''s face is attracting my eye and there''s just a hint of its nose to see.  I like it the more I look at it.</td>', 'Nice use of natural backlighting and the avoidance of silhouettes.  However the dog''s face is attracting my eye and there''s just a hint of its nose to see.  I like it the more I look at it.', '2006-01-17 11:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
