(2047911, 277487, 43340, '<td valign="top">How can you not love a baby?  But seriously, this is a fantastic backlighting shot.  I love the lighting on the left cheek and the light in both eyes.  Very well done.</td>', 'How can you not love a baby?  But seriously, this is a fantastic backlighting shot.  I love the lighting on the left cheek and the light in both eyes.  Very well done.', '2006-01-17 11:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
