(2049071, 278312, 48717, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, but it seems that the rose and the lily are competing for the attention since they both take up that same amount of space in the frame, might have been nice if both were in focus.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, but it seems that the rose and the lily are competing for the attention since they both take up that same amount of space in the frame, might have been nice if both were in focus.', '2006-01-17 15:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
