(2052478, 276708, 34247, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna find out where you live, and then buy up all the flowers within a 50-mile radius of your home. I''ll direct my minions of flower-eating bugs to then eradicate all other pesky freedom-loving, free-growing petals within the same area. As a pre-emptive strike, I''ll then turn on my weather machine and direct 100 years of winter for your town, to prevent a floral recovery. And then what are ya gonna do???<br/> <br/>Beautiful shots in recent weeks. Love how your flowers are far from generic, far from the ordinary everyday flower macro. There''s always that little extra touch that translate into something special.<br/> <br/>Therefore...I''m gonna find out where...etc.etc.etc.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-18 03:28:05.</i></td>', 'I''m gonna find out where you live, and then buy up all the flowers within a 50-mile radius of your home. I''ll direct my minions of flower-eating bugs to then eradicate all other pesky freedom-loving, free-growing petals within the same area. As a pre-emptive strike, I''ll then turn on my weather machine and direct 100 years of winter for your town, to prevent a floral recovery. And then what are ya gonna do??? Beautiful shots in recent weeks. Love how your flowers are far from generic, far from the ordinary everyday flower macro. There''s always that little extra touch that translate into something special. Therefore...I''m gonna find out where...etc.etc.etc.', '2006-01-18 03:26:03.000000', '2006-01-18 03:28:05.000000', 0),
