(2053037, 278458, 41845, '<td valign="top">Thanks Robert.  This was so simple its funny my husband had put some bulb christmas lights on the work bench in the garage.  A couple days later I thru some bubble wrap on top of it.  I was taking the garbage out and just about to grab the bubble wrap and throw it out when I thought huh wonder what if...one thing led to another.</td>', 'Thanks Robert.  This was so simple its funny my husband had put some bulb christmas lights on the work bench in the garage.  A couple days later I thru some bubble wrap on top of it.  I was taking the garbage out and just about to grab the bubble wrap and throw it out when I thought huh wonder what if...one thing led to another.', '2006-01-18 08:00:48.000000', NULL, 0),
