(2053170, 278702, 25655, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much Peter!<br/>I love this shot. What a beautiful sun in the middle of this cold winter.<br/>A photo that will make me smile every time!<br/>Thank you so much my dearest friend of all!<br/> <br/>Edit to add: congratulations for the top 10.<br/>Should have been much higher, but this is a lot better then the "top 20" hope, isn''t it?  ;-)<br/>Expect higher, aim higher - find yourself higher. A tip for the good life!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-18 08:43:18.</i></td>', 'Thank you so much Peter!I love this shot. What a beautiful sun in the middle of this cold winter.A photo that will make me smile every time!Thank you so much my dearest friend of all! Edit to add: congratulations for the top 10.Should have been much higher, but this is a lot better then the "top 20" hope, isn''t it?  ;-)Expect higher, aim higher - find yourself higher. A tip for the good life!', '2006-01-18 08:40:36.000000', '2006-01-18 08:43:18.000000', 0),
