(2054034, 278310, 45790, '<td valign="top">I guess if it doesn''t hit you in the face it just won''t score well. <br/> <br/>Interesting that such a poor scoring shot didn''t get many comments saying why it stinks. (Hey folks, if you give it a low score you are supposted to leave a comment why you did it!)<br/> <br/>It''s also in focus. There just happens to be alot of moisture in the air.<br/></td>', 'I guess if it doesn''t hit you in the face it just won''t score well.  Interesting that such a poor scoring shot didn''t get many comments saying why it stinks. (Hey folks, if you give it a low score you are supposted to leave a comment why you did it!) It''s also in focus. There just happens to be alot of moisture in the air.', '2006-01-18 12:09:38.000000', NULL, 0),
