(2055123, 278479, 48487, '<td valign="top">Title probably hurt me.  The backlit subject of the shot was the plume of water vapor.  Title called attention to the towers, which were sillhouettes.  Perhaps a title like "Powerful Vapor" would have fared better.</td>', 'Title probably hurt me.  The backlit subject of the shot was the plume of water vapor.  Title called attention to the towers, which were sillhouettes.  Perhaps a title like "Powerful Vapor" would have fared better.', '2006-01-18 16:55:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2055301, 279527, 714, '<td valign="top">Wow, with all the 1''s and 2''s you still received second place!  Way to go!  Congrats!</td>', 'Wow, with all the 1''s and 2''s you still received second place!  Way to go!  Congrats!', '2006-01-18 17:33:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2055312, 279196, 50864, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the helpful and generous comments.  This is a pitcher plant (Sarracenia leucophylla) so it is carniverous.</td>', 'Thank you all for the helpful and generous comments.  This is a pitcher plant (Sarracenia leucophylla) so it is carniverous.', '2006-01-18 17:35:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2055345, 279417, 39106, '<td valign="top">How could this picture get 12 1''s? Looks like there are some haters out there. 1''s are for out of focus pictures that don''t meet the challenge.<br/>Without them this would have scored in the 6 range and finished much higher. Congratulations Napalm on a great picture.</td>', 'How could this picture get 12 1''s? Looks like there are some haters out there. 1''s are for out of focus pictures that don''t meet the challenge.Without them this would have scored in the 6 range and finished much higher. Congratulations Napalm on a great picture.', '2006-01-18 17:45:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2055347, 279354, 5286, '<td valign="top">I knew this had to be yours. I didn''t vote, but this is amazingly beautiful! <br/>Congratulations :)</td>', 'I knew this had to be yours. I didn''t vote, but this is amazingly beautiful! Congratulations :)', '2006-01-18 17:46:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2055388, 279417, 19035, '<td valign="top">I am blown away by the people who dish out 1''s so easily, this deserved better, you can disagree with a subject matter, or style, but at least give someone credit for meeting the challenge topic, photogrpahic technique, etc.  I was also victim to quite a few ones and twos on this challenge.  I think you did a fine job on this photo.</td>', 'I am blown away by the people who dish out 1''s so easily, this deserved better, you can disagree with a subject matter, or style, but at least give someone credit for meeting the challenge topic, photogrpahic technique, etc.  I was also victim to quite a few ones and twos on this challenge.  I think you did a fine job on this photo.', '2006-01-18 17:56:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2055564, 279417, 48245, '<td valign="top">it would be interesting to have a mode on DPC so you can see how these "1" voters vote on other challenges... not necessary to identify who they are, just how they voted on other challenges...</td>', 'it would be interesting to have a mode on DPC so you can see how these "1" voters vote on other challenges... not necessary to identify who they are, just how they voted on other challenges...', '2006-01-18 18:35:11.000000', NULL, 0),
