(2058673, 279121, 50695, '<td valign="top">I knew my photo was going to be one of the lowest scorers, but I was amazed to find one of my 10''s scoring lower than mine! This is what I call a "painterly" photo. It''s a beautiful picture that an art-lover would appreciate for its color, composition, mood, the way the eye moves along its shapes, etc. Art lovers never step up to a Kandinsky and say, "hey this is out of focus!"</td>', 'I knew my photo was going to be one of the lowest scorers, but I was amazed to find one of my 10''s scoring lower than mine! This is what I call a "painterly" photo. It''s a beautiful picture that an art-lover would appreciate for its color, composition, mood, the way the eye moves along its shapes, etc. Art lovers never step up to a Kandinsky and say, "hey this is out of focus!"', '2006-01-19 09:28:05.000000', NULL, 0),
