(2077276, 279444, 15648, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by loseme:</b></div><hr/><i> Sweet shot, Silvertide is so aweosme. Good work. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the compliment on the Nick Perri shot. I am a concert photographer. I have photographed Silvertide 4 times. Check out my website:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.LegatoMuzicPhotography.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.LegatoMuzicPhotography.com</a></td>', 'Originally posted by loseme: Sweet shot, Silvertide is so aweosme. Good work.   Thanks for the compliment on the Nick Perri shot. I am a concert photographer. I have photographed Silvertide 4 times. Check out my website: //www.LegatoMuzicPhotography.com', '2006-01-24 07:36:55.000000', NULL, 0),
