(2141435, 277326, 50685, '<td valign="top">I''m very happy.  I didn''t know what I was doing but the pic came out OK.  I see my error was a 1 second shutter speed with no tripod.  I didn''e even realize that my shutter speed whas 1 second when i took the pic.  It looks out of focus but i think I probably moved and blured it.  I will retake this shot now that I have learned from everyone''s helpfull comments.<br/> <br/>Thank you all.</td>', 'I''m very happy.  I didn''t know what I was doing but the pic came out OK.  I see my error was a 1 second shutter speed with no tripod.  I didn''e even realize that my shutter speed whas 1 second when i took the pic.  It looks out of focus but i think I probably moved and blured it.  I will retake this shot now that I have learned from everyone''s helpfull comments. Thank you all.', '2006-02-10 22:09:13.000000', NULL, 0),
